      "_id": "69cd1aa93e56aceadd9f1dc7",
      "latePostId": "69cce83216f2f446658defb8",
      "content": "ChatGPT doesn't remember you 🤖\n\nEvery conversation starts completely from zero by default.\n\nThe AI you had a breakthrough session with last week? No record of it. You're a stranger every time you open a new chat.\n\nThe optional memory feature exists — but it stores structured summaries you've explicitly saved. Not experiences. Not learning. A database lookup.\n\nThere is no continuous 'it' accumulating wisdom from your interactions. Each session is stateless. The conversation window is the memory. When the tab closes, it ends.\n\nThe feeling of continuity is an interface design choice — not a reflection of how the model works.\n\n#aifacts #chatgpt #artificialintelligence #llm #aimyths #tech #aiexplained #machinelearning",
