      "content": "AI compute doubled every 6 months from 2012 to 2022 ⚡\n\nThat's 4x faster than Moore's Law.\n\nBetween GPT-2 (2019) and GPT-4 (2023) — just four years — AI training compute increased by 1,000 times. Not incremental progress. A complete rewriting of what's computationally possible in a single hardware generation cycle.\n\nNo technology in recorded history has compounded this fast across this many orders of magnitude.\n\nEvery AI timeline forecast — when will AI reach human-level at X task, when will it pass Y threshold — is ultimately a single bet: does this doubling pace continue, or does it hit a physical ceiling?\n\nThat's the only variable that actually matters.\n\n#aifacts #artificialintelligence #aicompute #airevolution #machinelearning #futuretech #tech #aifuture",
