      "_id": "69cc16c09ebe3a2c7009bf64",
      "latePostId": "69cb89826be338f1f253e9df",
      "content": "The cost to train a cutting-edge AI has dropped 99% in under 5 years 📉\n\nThe cost to train a cutting-edge AI has dropped 99% in under 5 years 📉\n\nGPT-2 (2019): $50,000\nGPT-3 (2020): $4.6 million\nGPT-4 (2022): ~$100 million\nDeepSeek-R1 (2025): $6 million for near-GPT-4 performance\n\nBy 2025, equivalent capability can be reached for $50,000 to $100,000.\n\nThis is the fastest cost compression of any technology in history.\n\nThe AI models that seem out of reach for small companies today will be commodity tools in three years. Every competitive advantage built on AI capability is sitting on a shrinking clock.\n\nThe only durable edge: speed of implementation.\n\n#aifacts #ai #deepseek #gpt4 #machinelearning #artificialintelligence #techtrends #futureofai",
